{"ID":"20240314091859-wzlt9b9","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091859-wzlt9b9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091859-wzlt9b9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165930-xjio002\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165930-zp6sw5l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422165930-zp6sw5l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:15,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:15\u0026#125;","title":"【文蛤汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422165930"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422165930-xjio002","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422165930-xjio002","updated":"20240422165930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吐后，渴欲得水而贪饮者，文蛤汤主之。兼主微风，脉紧头痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165930-0a4sek6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165930-0a4sek6","updated":"20240422165930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"文蛤汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165930-nhr1l7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165930-nhr1l7q","updated":"20240422165930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄三两杏仁五十枚大枣十二枚甘草石膏文蛤各五两生姜三两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165930-sa139er","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165930-sa139er","updated":"20240422165930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右七味，以水六升，煑取二升，温服一升，汗出即愈。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422165930-tjckrxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165930-tjckrxu","updated":"20240422165930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吐以后，结果呢，胃的津液没啦，渴欲得水而贪饮者，就是很严重的口渴。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165930-cl41uxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165930-cl41uxy","updated":"20240422165930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"文蛤汤呢，我们用海蛤蜊的那个壳打碎，你不要拿整个壳丢下去哦，那个没办法煮，打碎掉再去煮。这个文蛤汤主之，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"兼主微风，脉紧头痛"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你看，文蛤汤里面有麻黄杏仁石膏，你先不要看其它。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄、杏仁、石膏、甘草，是麻杏甘石汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"杏仁呢，润肺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以外，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"石膏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"能够怎么样？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"去热，去肺家的热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，能够止渴。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因为脉有紧，有头痛，代表有表寒表湿。所以说会用麻黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。原因在这里面。那文蛤呢，这个前面有单味的文蛤使用，就是燥渴，口渴得很严重的时候，会用这个文蛤汤。那个海蛤的壳，打碎掉再去煮哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165930-zz9vsgw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165930-zz9vsgw","updated":"20240422165930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"七味药六碗水煮成两碗。那你处方的时候呢，像麻黄三钱，杏仁你也可以三钱，等量就不会有问题。甘草文蛤呢各五钱，石膏也是五钱，生姜二片三片都没有关系，这个是它的剂量。如果你用七碗水或者六碗水煮成两碗的时候哦，就早晚喝一碗。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165930-c52ogyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165930-c52ogyd","updated":"20240422165930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你表面上看起来病人口渴，贪饮，需要喝得很多，结果还是在使用麻黄。当然很多人呢过去都不敢用麻黄哦，看麻黄桂枝好像蛇蝎一样，不敢用它。因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄发表的力量很强，它外号又叫青龙，那病人水发散太多的话，病人会更渴。而在这里，大家看是用麻黄来止渴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以大家要善用麻黄，而不能因为麻黄的一些外症，你不敢用麻黄，不会用麻黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165930-q0bia2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165930-q0bia2v","updated":"20240422165930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后面会慢慢介绍到更多使用麻黄的处方。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"像我们常常在治疗那个尿毒症的时候，如果病人水肿，那我们那个四逆汤或是那个当归四逆汤下去，心脏功能没有办法恢复，我们会用麻黄让它恢复"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。麻黄是回阳，因为它能够壮心阳，心脏起来以后才会流汗。所以病人吃了你的药，当你心里面在开方说我要把他心脏功能恢复的时候，你常常就问他，你吃了我的药有没有出汗？有有有，我有感觉到我出汗，药到了。如果吃了药没有出汗，代表心脏功能还没有恢复。好不好好。"}]},{"ID":"20240422165930-zp6sw5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422165930-zp6sw5l","updated":"20240422165930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们今天介绍到这里，明天再见。"}]}]}